---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---
<section id="view-monitoring" class="view-section" hidden>
  <article class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <div><h2>Monitoring</h2><p>Grafana graphs built from recorded inference requests for one model version.</p></div>
      <a id="grafana-open" class="quiet-button" hidden href="http://127.0.0.1:3000/d/mlpp-workspace" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="external" />Open Grafana</a>
    </div>
    <div class="form-grid">
      <label>Registered model version<select id="monitor-version"><option value="">Choose a version</option></select></label>
      <label>Time range<select id="monitor-range"><option value="15m">Last 15 minutes</option><option value="1h">Last hour</option><option value="6h">Last 6 hours</option><option value="24h">Last 24 hours</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <div id="monitor-summary" class="muted-note">Select a registered version to inspect its observations.</div>
    <p class="monitor-disclaimer">These graphs measure inference, not training loss. Declared demo delays are artificial, and missing observations stay unknown.</p>
  </article>
  <div id="grafana-panels" class="grafana-grid"></div>
  <article class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <div><h2>Explain this window</h2><p>Ask the local model to summarise the measured observations.</p></div>
      <button class="secondary" id="diagnose-button" type="button" disabled>Explain observations</button>
    </div>
    <div id="diagnosis-result"></div>
  </article>
</section>
